{% comment %}
  SHEmakes — the discount tab.

  Klaviyo's own teaser is an image the shop cannot restyle from here, and the
  brief asked for the small transparent button RBA uses. So the theme draws the
  button and Klaviyo keeps the form behind it: clicking calls Klaviyo's own
  openForm, which is the same pop-up their teaser would have opened.

  With no form ID set, nothing renders and Klaviyo's teaser is left alone.
{% endcomment %}

{%- if settings.sm_klaviyo_form_id != blank -%}
  <button
    type="button"
    class="sm-discount-tab sm-discount-tab--{{ settings.sm_klaviyo_side | default: 'left' }}"
    data-sm-klaviyo-form="{{ settings.sm_klaviyo_form_id }}"
  >
    {{ settings.sm_klaviyo_label | default: 'Get 10% Off' }}
  </button>
{%- endif -%}
